    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/049643150630622ab12d5adc54f469c2.avif?t=1742309596\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on our official Discord!\u00a0</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Stop Dr. Corvid's Elemental Chaos</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Corvid, a mad scientist with a penchant for chaos, has unleashed his latest experiment \u2014 the Virballs, virus-like creatures that manipulate elemental forces. Now, entire planets are overrun with these mischievous entities, spreading fire, wind, and electrical havoc across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As ORB, an Object Removal Bot armed with rocket-powered claws, it\u2019s up to you to track down these volatile creatures, harness their powers, and save the galaxy from Corvid\u2019s creations before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Collect, Combine, and Conquer</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this thrilling, action-packed platformer and stop the spread of Dr. Corvid\u2019s chaos. Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll be doing in Virballs:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture and Combine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab Virballs with ORB\u2019s grappler claws and fuse their elemental properties \u2014 Earth, Water, Fire, Electricity, Air, and Slime \u2014 into unique hybrid weapons. Experiment with more than 40 different combinations to unlock powerful new ways to battle enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/a152d5527f011ac08b9c513ec8369605.poster.avif?t=1742309596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/a152d5527f011ac08b9c513ec8369605.webm?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/a152d5527f011ac08b9c513ec8369605.mp4?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and blast through levels packed with enemies, traps, and environmental puzzles. With ORB\u2019s trusty blasters, thrusters, and claws, you\u2019ll conquer every obstacle in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/55b30b03a0c9f67c294609508a4f547b.poster.avif?t=1742309596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/55b30b03a0c9f67c294609508a4f547b.webm?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/55b30b03a0c9f67c294609508a4f547b.mp4?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purge the Infested Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique planets have been infested with Dr. Corvid\u2019s Virballs. Each planet poses new threats and requires creative use of Virball powers to clear the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/f733373c945fa8fe53bf752e9af93efa.avif?t=1742309596\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Floobers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adorable, peaceful Floobers are in danger - help the Floober King rescue his people and evacuate to their ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/c9e1713b2befe59c7ab5059ef77453c8.poster.avif?t=1742309596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/c9e1713b2befe59c7ab5059ef77453c8.webm?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/c9e1713b2befe59c7ab5059ef77453c8.mp4?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge ultra-powerful Virball bosses to unlock new elemental Cores, expanding ORB\u2019s arsenal and unlocking even more devastating weapon combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing Galactic Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in Steam Early Access, with more planets and missions added over time. The full game, featuring all six planets, launches in early 2025!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Stop Dr. Corvid's Elemental Chaos</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Corvid, a mad scientist with a penchant for chaos, has unleashed his latest experiment \u2014 the Virballs, virus-like creatures that manipulate elemental forces. Now, entire planets are overrun with these mischievous entities, spreading fire, wind, and electrical havoc across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As ORB, an Object Removal Bot armed with rocket-powered claws, it\u2019s up to you to track down these volatile creatures, harness their powers, and save the galaxy from Corvid\u2019s creations before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Collect, Combine, and Conquer</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into this thrilling, action-packed platformer and stop the spread of Dr. Corvid\u2019s chaos. Here\u2019s what you\u2019ll be doing in Virballs:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Capture and Combine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab Virballs with ORB\u2019s grappler claws and fuse their elemental properties \u2014 Earth, Water, Fire, Electricity, Air, and Slime \u2014 into unique hybrid weapons. Experiment with more than 40 different combinations to unlock powerful new ways to battle enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/a152d5527f011ac08b9c513ec8369605.poster.avif?t=1742309596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/a152d5527f011ac08b9c513ec8369605.webm?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/a152d5527f011ac08b9c513ec8369605.mp4?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced Platformer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and blast through levels packed with enemies, traps, and environmental puzzles. With ORB\u2019s trusty blasters, thrusters, and claws, you\u2019ll conquer every obstacle in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/55b30b03a0c9f67c294609508a4f547b.poster.avif?t=1742309596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/55b30b03a0c9f67c294609508a4f547b.webm?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/55b30b03a0c9f67c294609508a4f547b.mp4?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Purge the Infested Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique planets have been infested with Dr. Corvid\u2019s Virballs. Each planet poses new threats and requires creative use of Virball powers to clear the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/f733373c945fa8fe53bf752e9af93efa.avif?t=1742309596\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Floobers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adorable, peaceful Floobers are in danger - help the Floober King rescue his people and evacuate to their ship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/c9e1713b2befe59c7ab5059ef77453c8.poster.avif?t=1742309596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/c9e1713b2befe59c7ab5059ef77453c8.webm?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343110/extras/c9e1713b2befe59c7ab5059ef77453c8.mp4?t=1742309596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge ultra-powerful Virball bosses to unlock new elemental Cores, expanding ORB\u2019s arsenal and unlocking even more devastating weapon combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Growing Galactic Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your journey in Steam Early Access, with more planets and missions added over time. The full game, featuring all six planets, launches in early 2025!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
